WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.663
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.663 --> 00:00:06.700
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:06.875
.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:09.637
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:12.575
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:14.213
outside your authority.

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:16.950
On this slide, as Industry Team Scribe, you

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.238
turn deliberation into the durable Industry Team record.

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:23.375
In practice, listen for intent, assumptions, and

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.350
trade-offs;

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.950
make them legible in Strategic Orientation and proposals before the

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.337
handoff deadline.

00:00:29.835 --> 00:00:32.547
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:32.547 --> 00:00:35.273
Draft and revise team-owned artifacts.

00:00:35.273 --> 00:00:38.735
Preserve rationale and required structured fields.

00:00:38.735 --> 00:00:40.922
Use the explicit handoff control;

00:00:40.922 --> 00:00:43.460
visibility alone is not submission.
